To Test a New Prompt:
 - Navigate to the Left Bar -> Edit Tab
 - write any changes to the prompt in the prompt editor
 - click Save Changes below the editor

If you have code running locally:
To Upload New Documentation:
 - Add to Knowledge folder in code
To Add Documentation to Vector DB:
python3 manage_vector_store.py upload \
  --vector-store-id vs_68bcc5297c1c8191a1c3fe60cd775b88 \
  --files Knowledge/your_new_file.txt

(this uploads the document to OpenAI Vector DB)

To Run Program:
run:
streamlit run streamlit_app.py
